 259: tails.  Table 6 is light (new sessions only; no earlier kill moves): base; R2w, R2w2, WT6, WTsplit, RD2L0, L1gate,
 260: L3gate, dataA (the new rows' own kills); PLUS two the seat did not build -- RD2 gated to lane 1 alone and to lane 3
 261: alone ("covered by construction through R2w's E-load flips" is a prediction, and lane 3's carrier is the stub, whose
 262: rows are the ones being introduced).  Pass 5: full roster, verifies the enumeration cell by cell, hunts nothing.
