 121: accumulating (item 6's "accumulate" reason is false; corrected in place).  The cell carries no idata/value joint, so it
 122: is single-axis and FLOOR, not debt.  **Caveat repair 13 must honour:** the seat's first TIME rows were VACUOUS (a
 123: factor-of-2, a false red on a control); only the GAPPED shape of `post7c.py` works (~13,000x separation).  The CHANNEL
 124: line for the TIME row must be SHOWN to vary under E2, not merely written -- this pass is the evidence that a correctly
 125: named channel can still be vacuous in the shape you row it in.
