 243: Repair 6 is new floor-bound material; retyped rows are measured, not assumed (RA2).  Table 7 = base + the eight cells'
 244: representatives + the `nox`/`noff` controls.  Closing pass 6 VERIFIES the enumeration -- and it is not a rubber stamp:
